{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE AMAZON!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a fantastic adventure through the Amazon Rainforest! With the blessings of the gods, explore lush landscapes from the heart of the Amazon, meet captivating allies, unlock divine powers, and overcome treacherous challenges born from demonic corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/2d595f66d03dd27fa8d84b8db7d3c0e7.avif?t=1773786266\" width=634 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES LIKE YOU\u2019VE NEVER SEEN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the Sokoban genre in a whole new light! Inspired by the classics, Amazon Warrior challenges the mind with innovative and highly demanding puzzles in a unique narrative-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/6c359200a5ddbd34c39cdf3f400473d5.avif?t=1773786266\" width=1311 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVE INTO AN ENGAGING STORY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the puzzles, Amazon Eclipse features a linear storyline filled with powerful twists and unforgettable characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/2cb9196e16eed39128fc19f71013d10f.avif?t=1773786266\" width=635 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY USING ONLY ARROW KEYS / WASD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for easy-to-play yet hard-to-master challenges? Amazon Warrior has been tested as accessible even for children as young as 8, but completing it will be a true trial of skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE THE LAND OF THE AMAZONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Tayana, a strong Jaluaci warrior, against the terrifying Nightmare Demon that plagues the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jaluacis are descendants of the South American Amazons, warrior women named by early explorers and known throughout the region as the \u201cwomen without husbands.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/3b878b7209c01ba0fbdeb4eadd9979ac.avif?t=1773786266\" width=635 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash divine power in an epic Amazonian battle against the Nightmare Demon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A TRULY AMAZONIAN GAME, MADE BY AMAZONIANS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/3d08b88da906b92ce694f160d124906b.avif?t=1773786266\" width=634 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031700?t=1773786266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/7d3b498ecaf7973a29e8bee0a42baa2ff755b863/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773786266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/da1e5641436d5f77410f34957fd6399d785f5d14/capsule_