ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/2cb9196e16eed39128fc19f71013d10f.avif?t=1773786266\" width=635 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY USING ONLY ARROW KEYS / WASD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for easy-to-play yet hard-to-master challenges? Amazon Warrior has been tested as accessible even for children as young as 8, but completing it will be a true trial of skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE THE LAND OF THE AMAZONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Tayana, a strong Jaluaci warrior, against the terrifying Nightmare Demon that plagues the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jaluacis are descendants of the South American Amazons, warrior women named by early explorers and known throughout the region as the \u201cwomen without husbands.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/3b878b7209c01ba0fbdeb4eadd9979ac.avif?t=1773786266\" width=635 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash divine power in an epic Amazonian battle against the Nightmare Demon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A TRULY AMAZONIAN GAME, MADE BY AMAZONIANS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031700/extras/3d08b88da906b92ce694f160d124906b.avif?t=1773786266\" width=634 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["iauti Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id"